<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT S.AFRICA BY TWO WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT S.AFRICA BY TWO WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>PORT ELIZABETH, South Africa 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia beat South Africa by two wickets on the fourth day of the second test in Port Elizabeth on Monday.</p>
<p>They take a 2-0 lead in the three test series which concludes with the final test beginning in Centurion on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: South Africa 209 and 168, Australia 108 and 271-8 (Mark Waugh 116). Australia won by two wickets.</p>
